---
// Reusable Differentiators Component
---
<section class="bg-white py-24 border-t border-gray-100">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-6 lg:px-16">
    <div class="mb-16 text-center md:text-left border-b border-gray-200 pb-8">
      <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#0070BA] mb-2">WHY RISHIKA INFRA?</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#17212B]">Our Differentiators</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-x-8 gap-y-12">
      <!-- Feature 1 -->
      <div class="group cursor-pointer">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-[#FFC62F] text-[#FFC62F] group-hover:bg-[#FFC62F] group-hover:text-white transition-all">
             <span class="font-bold text-xl">🛡️</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#17212B]">Safety First</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Eliminates the need for personnel to climb towers or work near energized equipment.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Feature 2 -->
      <div class="group cursor-pointer">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-[#FFC62F] text-[#FFC62F] group-hover:bg-[#FFC62F] group-hover:text-white transition-all">
             <span class="font-bold text-xl">⚙️</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#17212B]">Advanced Tech</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Modern UAV platforms with visual, LiDAR, and radiometric thermal sensors.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Feature 3 -->
      <div class="group cursor-pointer">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-[#FFC62F] text-[#FFC62F] group-hover:bg-[#FFC62F] group-hover:text-white transition-all">
             <span class="font-bold text-xl">⏱️</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#17212B]">Cost Efficiency</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Reduces inspection time, manpower requirements, and operational downtime.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Feature 4 -->
      <div class="group cursor-pointer">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-[#FFC62F] text-[#FFC62F] group-hover:bg-[#FFC62F] group-hover:text-white transition-all">
             <span class="font-bold text-xl">🎯</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#17212B]">Improved Accuracy</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-gray-600">High-resolution imaging enables precise defect identification and actionable insight.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>